      "created_at": "2022-07-01T16:05:46Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-07-01T16:05:46Z",
      "body": "As an example. The document links to this URL https://github.com/mikewest/privacy-budget\r\n\r\nIt is neither a Normative or Informative reference and the version is not referenced. The document is on a personal GitHub repository.\r\n\r\nThe privacy budget is now an important part of Google's agreement with the CMA. The work on UACH should be aligned to that wider work. Perhaps you could seek guidance from your colleagues as part of the training you are receiving in relation to the commitments concerning how you are required to do that? If you have not received the required training could you let ING know please.\r\n\r\nI would prefer to as a minimum receive a link to the detailed information concerning how this proposal relates to others under the title 'Privacy Sandbox' before any further changes are deployed to the market.",
